# Copy to .env.local and fill in.
#
# Server-side only — this key is never exposed to the browser. The client posts
# {stateId, techniqueId, lang, situation} to /api/coach and the server builds
# the prompt and calls Anthropic. There is deliberately no NEXT_PUBLIC_ variant.
#
# Set a spend cap on the key in the Anthropic Console: at ~$0.03/request that is
# the real backstop against abuse, more than any rate limit in the code — the
# in-process limiter is per serverless instance, so it is a speed bump, not a cap.
#
# Use a key scoped to THIS app. Sharing one key across projects means one app's
# traffic can exhaust the other's budget, and neither can be revoked alone.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Canonical production origin, no trailing slash — e.g. https://cortex.app
# Optional: same-host and *.vercel.app preview requests are allowed anyway, so
# the app works before a custom domain exists. Set it once you have one.
SITE_ORIGIN=
